ata-astro-cid-poxfbvb2></path></svg></span></a><a href="/articles/agent-observability/" data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2><span data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2><span class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2>Foundations</span><strong data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2>Agent observability</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2><svg class="icon-arrow" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2><path d="M2 8h12m-5-5 5 5-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2></path></svg></span></a><a href="/articles/human-oversight/" data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2><span data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2><span class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2>Foundations</span><strong data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2>Human oversight</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2><svg class="icon-arrow" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2><path d="M2 8h12m-5-5 5 5-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-poxfbvb2></path></svg></span></a></section></article></div></main><footer class="site-footer shell"><div><a class="footer-name" href="/">Agentic Bible</a><p>A little more context. A clearer understanding.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><a href="/about/#editorial">Editorial approach</a><a href="https://github.com/Leshey-Digital/agentic-bible">GitHub <svg class="icon-arrow" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a><span>Preview · October 2026</span></div></footer><script type="module" src="/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.D-1rZP_q.js"></script></body></html><script type="module" src="/_astro/_id_.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.psVNdFbS.js"></script>